Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean follower texts
Applies after 0071-korean-summary-move-types.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): the follower's messages
are read from followers/text/ko.bin. The builder fetches none for the Korean
ROM, so the follower cries instead of speaking HGSS's English lines.

diff --git a/src/follower_mon.c b/src/follower_mon.c
--- a/src/follower_mon.c
+++ b/src/follower_mon.c
@@ -1074,6 +1074,8 @@
     return "fr";
 #elif GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_ITALIAN
     return "it";
+#elif GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN
+    return "ko"; // no Korean bank yet: the follower only cries, it does not speak English
 #else
     return "en";
 #endif
